48	     *          |      +-------+-------+           |
49	     *          |              |                   |
50	     *          |              v                   |
51	     *          |      +-------+-------+           |
52	     *          +----- | Restoring (1) | <---+     |
53	     *          |      +-------+-------+     |     |
