62	     *          +---> |  Suspended (3) | ----+     |    //TODO Suspended(3) could be removed after we've stable on KIP-429
63	     *                +--------+-------+           |
64	     *                         |                   |
65	     *                         v                   |
66	     *                +--------+-------+           |
67	     *                |   Closed (4)   | ----------+
68	     *                +----------------+
